# This Machine

Facts about the host this session is running on. Rendered from the live system by
yadm's template processor — the source is `.claude/machine.md##template.default`
in the dotfiles repo, re-rendered on every `yadm alt`. Authoritative for this
session; the home repo README explains what each machine implies.

| Fact | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Hostname | `{{yadm.hostname}}` |
| Architecture | `{{yadm.arch}}` |
| OS | `{{yadm.os}}` |
| User | `{{yadm.user}}` |

See the home repo README § Which machine am I on for what this host means for
session mode, review flow, and which services are local versus remote from here.
